<title>FRANCE: Few changes to EU grain balance in latest week.</title>
<headline>Few changes to EU grain balance in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Small-scale wheat imports were among the few changes to the European Union's grain balance in the week to June 17, European Commission figures showed.</p>
<p>Soft wheat imports rose by 44,000 tonnes to reach 1.104 million tonnes for the period from July 1, 1996, to June 17, 1997.</p>
<p>Cumulative imports of all grain and products reached 4.340 million tonnes compared with 4.284 million between July 1 and June 10, 1997.</p>
<p>Cumulative exports since July 1 reached 26.819 million tonnes compared with 26.774 million up to the previous week.</p>
</text>
